# sdist of the core (rust-deobf). The package modules, scripts/data/*.json, pyproject.toml,
# setup.py, README.md and LICENSE are added by setuptools; premium/, tests/, bench_src/, build/,
# gallery/ and assets/ are deliberately NOT in the core sdist (premium/ is its own distribution).
include CHANGELOG.md LICENSING.md CLA.md
prune premium
prune tests
prune build
